{
  "name": "Email a PDF certificate for each new Google Sheets row",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -620,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Email a PDF certificate for each new row in Google Sheets\n\nWhen a learner is added to your sheet, this workflow fills a certificate design with their name, course and date, turns it into a PDF and emails it to them. No HTML to write.\n\n### How it works\n1. **New learner row** watches your sheet for new rows.\n2. **Make certificate PDF** sends the row to a saved certificate design on thirds.ai and waits for the PDF.\n3. **PDF ready?** checks the status. If the file is still being made, **Wait 3s** and **Check PDF status** loop until it is done.\n4. **Download PDF** fetches the finished file.\n5. **Email certificate** sends it as an attachment.\n\n### Set up\n1. Sheet columns: `learner`, `email`, `course`, `date`.\n2. On thirds.ai, open the Portrait course certificate in the gallery (https://thirds.ai/gallery/completion-certificate?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=community&utm_campaign=own-content&utm_content=n8n-certificate-template), click Use this template, put your logo on it, and copy the Template ID (starts with `tpl_`).\n3. Make an API key on thirds.ai and add it in n8n as a **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_KEY`.\n4. Paste your Template ID into **Make certificate PDF** and set your issuer name.\n5. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail.\n\nEach finished PDF uses one credit; a failed one costs nothing. A free account gets 50 credits a month. Self-hosted? You can use the thirds.ai community node instead of the HTTP Request node.\n\nGuide: https://thirds.ai/integrations/n8n?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=community&utm_campaign=own-content&utm_content=n8n-certificate-template\n\n(Disclosure: I'm connected to thirds.ai.)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "name": "Note: retries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        160,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 260,
        "height": 160,
        "content": "Retry key = row number + email, so a re-run never charges twice for the same learner."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "New learner row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {},
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Make certificate PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://thirds.ai/v1/pdf",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"template_id\": \"tpl_PASTE_YOUR_TEMPLATE_ID\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"issuer\": \"Your organisation\",\n    \"learner\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.learner) }},\n    \"course\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.course) }},\n    \"date\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.date) }}\n  }\n}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "=cert-{{ $json.row_number }}-{{ $json.email }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "PDF ready?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "succeeded"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Wait 3s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        440,
        220
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "seconds",
        "amount": 3
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Check PDF status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        660,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://thirds.ai/v1/pdf/{{ $json.id }}",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "name": "Download PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://thirds.ai{{ $json.download.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "name": "Email certificate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('New learner row').item.json.email }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('New learner row').item.json.learner }},\n\nWell done on finishing the course. Your certificate is attached.",
        "options": {
          "attachmentsUi": {
            "attachmentsBinary": [
              {
                "property": "data"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "subject": "=Your certificate for {{ $('New learner row').item.json.course }}",
        "emailType": "text"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "name": "Still rendering?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        440,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "or",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "queued"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "running"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "name": "Stop: PDF failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "position": [
        660,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "={{ 'PDF ' + $json.status + ': ' + JSON.stringify($json.error) }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Wait 3s": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check PDF status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "PDF ready?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Still rendering?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email certificate",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "New learner row": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Make certificate PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check PDF status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "PDF ready?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Still rendering?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait 3s",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Stop: PDF failed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Make certificate PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "PDF ready?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}